  "description": "Meet Honey Cutie with Extras, a charming and expressive bold modern script font created to bring sweetness, confidence, and personality to your creative projects.\nWith its bold strokes, smooth curves, flowing connections, and playful handwritten character, Honey Cutie combines a modern aesthetic with a cute and feminine touch. Its confident appearance makes it stand out beautifully in both large display designs and stylish branding applications.\nWhether you’re creating a trendy logo, beautiful packaging, social media content, apparel, invitations, or eye-catching promotional artwork, Honey Cutie adds an effortlessly sweet and memorable personality to your typography.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Meet Honey Cutie with Extras, a charming and expressive bold modern script font created to bring sweetness, confidence, and personality to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>With its bold strokes, smooth curves, flowing connections, and playful handwritten character, Honey Cutie combines a modern aesthetic with a cute and feminine touch. Its confident appearance makes it stand out beautifully in both large display designs and stylish branding applications.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating a trendy logo, beautiful packaging, social media content, apparel, invitations, or eye-catching promotional artwork, Honey Cutie adds an effortlessly sweet and memorable personality to your typography.</p>",
